{"id":"zusa_tzlich","lemma":"zusätzlich","pos":"adj","rank":4670,"glosses":["additional, extra, supplementary","ancillary"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ad/De-zus%C3%A4tzlich.ogg/De-zus%C3%A4tzlich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Das kostet dich noch zusätzlich was.","en":"That'll cost you extra.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/758926","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to cost","l":"kosten"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},{"g":"still / yet"},null,{"g":"what"}]},{"text":"Wird das zusätzlich kosten?","en":"Will there be an extra charge for that?","words":[{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"to cost"}]},{"text":"Nichtmitglieder zahlen 50 Dollar zusätzlich.","en":"Non-members pay an additional 50 dollars.","words":[null,{"g":"to pay"},{"g":"dollar"},null]},{"text":"Diese Arbeit bringt ihm zusätzlich 60.000 Yen im Monat ein.","en":"That job brings him in an extra 60,000 yen a month.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"toil"},{"g":"to bring","l":"bringen"},{"g":"(to) him","l":"er"},null,{"g":"yen"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"month"},{"g":"a"}]},{"text":"Es gab ein Erdbeben und zusätzlich noch einen Tsunami.","en":"There was an earthquake and, in addition, there was a tsunami.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"earthquake"},{"g":"and"},null,{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"tsunami"}]}]}